         "// Unit (JVM, fast): viewModel.login emits the right state\n@Test fun `login success emits Authenticated`() {\n    val vm = LoginViewModel(FakeAuthRepo())\n    vm.login(\"user\", \"pass\")\n    assertEquals(AuthState.Authenticated, vm.state.value)\n}\n// Integration (middle): Room DAO test on an in-memory database\n// UI (slow, few): one Espresso test for the whole login journey",
