         "The test arranges a mocked repository returning an expired token, acts by calling ensureValidToken, and asserts the refreshed value. The mock/onBlocking/doReturn block is the Mockito-Kotlin DSL; runTest provides the coroutine scope. verify(repo).refresh() asserts the collaboration happened — use it sparingly and prefer asserting outcomes.",
