         "The workflow is measure-then-cut: APK Analyzer ranks size contributors, and each gets a targeted fix — ABI filters for native libraries, WebP or vectors for images, dynamic features for rarely used screens. The AAB format means Play does per-device APK generation, so your job is shrinking the bundle, not hand-splitting APKs.",
